        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXP5Slp6U3aik_bA-sdTVWWGSVkfNm1UyMABTvFr_zGyOWNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Best service ever they repaired my daughters glasses for free and im not even a client!!! I  will be a client from now on!!!",
